      <p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(245,230,216,0.85);margin:0 0 28px;">Here's the thing about the estrobolome: it doesn't reset overnight. The gut bacteria that regulate your estrogen need time to repopulate and rebalance. A 30-day guarantee would set you up to quit right before the shift happens. That's why Womankind gives you 90 days. Take the full three months. If your flashes haven't changed — for any reason — email for a full refund. No need to return the bottles. No hoops. No fine print. The only real risk isn't trying it. It's another year of flashes running your life. Another flush at the worst possible moment. Another night soaked through. Another gadget that cools the surface and ignores the cause. That's the real risk — not the one with a money-back guarantee attached.</p>
